          <feedback>Stage 1 (&quot;Create Poem&quot;) objective met. Execute created the new (previously untracked, hence empty `git diff`) file blocks/org/blockml/bml/workspace/playground/NextPoem.bml defining block org.blockml.bml.workspace.playground.NextPoem with type playground:NextPoem and baseType core:Documentation. It contains a fresh German poem about a tree (Eiche) and a mushroom (Pilz) — distinct from the existing PoemNew.bml poem — with &lt;documentation> body plus title/author/year properties (author &quot;John Doe&quot; matching the run parameters). Structure and namespace conventions follow the sibling playground/PoemNew.bml. No ModelTransformation / _meta/transform/ files were touched by Execute. Stage 2 (&quot;Translate Poem&quot; to Spanish) remains Pending and out of scope for this Stage. Note: the running transformation's parameters give language &quot;German&quot; but no `subject`; the poem is hardcoded to tree+mushroom per the InstructionTask, which is consistent with the task text. Validation could not be run here (Bash disabled), so BOM-level validity was not independently confirmed.</feedback>
